<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian birr weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian birr weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ethiopian birr weakened against the dollar on Monday, the central National Bank of Ethiopia said.</p>
<p>It posted the birr at a mean rate of 6.413 compared to 6.401 last week.</p>
<p>The bank posted the birr against the pound at a mean rate of 10.6885 from 10.6999 last week. Against the yen, the birr was traded at 0.056180 from 0.056149 and at 4.1235 against the mark from 4.1124 last week.</p>
</text>
